 patient might suddenly regain a massive burst of energy just days before they pass away.

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:24.680
 The rally.

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:25.680
 Yeah.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:26.680
 Yeah.

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:30.840
 So, um, if we are mapping this journey, let's just start at the very beginning.

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:37.960
 Let's start with the orchestrated crisis, the preoperative phase, exactly.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:42.800
 When you think about getting a patient ready for surgery, it really reminds me of a NASA

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:43.720
 preflight check.

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:47.120
 That's a really good analogy, actually.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:52.160
 It's this massive coordinated effort where every single system of the patient's body

