 Every single comfort measure has a clinical rationale.

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:34.040
 Okay.

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:36.320
 Let me push back on that idea for a second.

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:40.800
 Because there is a huge section in the preoperative protocols regarding patient anxiety.

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:41.800
 Yeah.

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:42.800
 That's a big focus.

