 outcome of a major surgery?

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:08.680
 It's an excellent question.

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:11.520
 And the answer is an absolute undeniable yes.

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:12.520
 Really?

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:15.600
 It is not just about having a pleasant experience.

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:20.960
 Psychological distress directly and measurably alters your physical, biological response to

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:21.960
 surgery.

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:22.960
 How so?

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:26.080
 Well, think about what anxiety actually is from a physiological standpoint.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:30.120
 When you are terrified, your sympathetic nervous system kicks into overdrive.

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:31.800
 The fight or flight response?

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:32.960
 Exactly.

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:37.600
 Your brain floods your bloodstream with stress hormones like adrenaline and cortisol.

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:41.960
 So your body is essentially bracing for a fight to the death, right as you are being

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:42.960
 wheeled in.

