00:49:51.920 --> 00:49:58.800
 The patient experiences immediate, excruciating pain, profound hypertension, and a classic

00:49:58.800 --> 00:50:03.600
 hallmark symptom is intense, board-like abdominal muscle rigidity.

00:50:03.600 --> 00:50:04.600
 Abdominal rigidity.

00:50:04.600 --> 00:50:09.040
 The muscle's cramps so violently that it often mimics the pain of acute appendicitis.

00:50:09.040 --> 00:50:13.560
 So for a recluse, you are trying to save the skin, but for a widow, you are trying to

00:50:13.560 --> 00:50:14.840
 calm the nervous system.

00:50:14.840 --> 00:50:15.840
 Right.

00:50:15.840 --> 00:50:20.280
 The treatment for a widow bite involves ice to slow the venom spread, elevation, powerful

00:50:20.280 --> 00:50:25.120
