00:50:25.120 --> 00:50:28.480
 of a specific anti-venin to neutralize the toxin.

00:50:28.480 --> 00:50:34.400
 Now beyond the physical traumas, the car crashes, the poisonings, the bites, the ER also serves

00:50:34.400 --> 00:50:39.480
 as the absolute primary safety net for a community's psychiatric emergencies.

00:50:39.480 --> 00:50:42.680
 That's a huge part of ER nursing.

00:50:42.680 --> 00:50:46.840
 The sources note that psychiatric patients present to the ER when they are completely

00:50:46.840 --> 00:50:49.920
