00:50:49.920 --> 00:50:56.320
 And in the chaos of the ER, they usually present in one of two ways, overactive or underactive.

00:50:56.320 --> 00:50:57.320
 Yes.

00:50:57.320 --> 00:50:59.520
 The overactive patient is highly visible.

00:50:59.520 --> 00:51:03.160
 They might be severely anxious, panicking, agitated, or even violent.

00:51:03.160 --> 00:51:04.160
 Right.

00:51:04.160 --> 00:51:10.000
 This is often exacerbated by substance intoxication or interestingly by underlying undiagnosed

00:51:10.000 --> 00:51:14.480
