00:52:17.200 --> 00:52:19.040
 They have to ask the hard questions.

00:52:19.040 --> 00:52:21.040
 They are trained not to beat around the bush.

00:52:21.040 --> 00:52:24.320
 They ask direct, uncomfortable questions.

00:52:24.320 --> 00:52:26.240
 Have you ever thought about taking your own life?

00:52:26.240 --> 00:52:28.480
 Do you have a plan to do it?

00:52:28.480 --> 00:52:33.520
 And this applies heavily to patients suffering from post-traumatic stress disorder, or PTSD.

00:52:33.520 --> 00:52:38.440
 The source has placed a very specific grave emphasis on military veterans here.

00:52:38.440 --> 00:52:39.440
 Yes.

00:52:39.440 --> 00:52:46.120
 The risk of PTSD and subsequent suicidal ideation is significantly higher in this population.

00:52:46.120 --> 00:52:50.800
 Almost 30% of veterans from the Iraq and Afghanistan wars experience PTSD.

00:52:50.800 --> 00:52:56.400
 The text also highlighted a specific devastating subcategory of trauma within that group.

00:52:56.400 --> 00:52:58.440
 Military sexual trauma, or MST.

00:52:58.440 --> 00:52:59.440
 Yes.

00:52:59.440 --> 00:53:01.000
 It's a huge issue.

00:53:01.000 --> 00:53:06.720
 This is PTSD resulting from sexual assault or severe sexual harassment experienced during

00:53:06.720 --> 00:53:08.280
